Research data (not part of the v1 model release)
-------------------------------------------------
corpus/ holds low-poly meshes converted to text for the mesh-as-text research track (docs/08, docs/11, docs/12):
- Objaverse objects under CC BY 4.0. Per-object author, licence and source URL are listed in
  corpus/objaverse_attribution.csv.
- Meshes from the Kenney (city-kit, car-kit) and Quaternius (megakit) asset packs, CC0.
- Quaternius props (ids m00xxx named "q-..."), CC0. Fourteen other props whose source could not be confirmed were
  removed on 22 Nov 2026.

The v1 training set on Hugging Face (meshwright-glimmer-30b-lora-distill) contains only Muse Glimmer 30B outputs
and does not use corpus/.
